WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:05.439 size:53% position:73% line:53%
; .c... vérifié 5:18

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:06.573 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Sibole!

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:07.741 size:53% position:73% line:53%
