00:00:41.408 --> 00:00:45.078 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:46.213 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Je suis allé fouillé dans

00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:47.481 size:53% position:73% line:53%
nos archives : à l'âge de 7 ans,

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:48.615 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vous décrochez votre

00:00:46.313 --> 00:00:49.750 size:53% position:73% line:53%
premier rôle, 1958.

00:00:47.581 --> 00:00:50.884 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Oui.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:52.018 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Quels souvenirs gardez-vous

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:53.119 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de cette époque-là?

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:54.154 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'était la série...

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:55.222 size:53% position:73% line:53%
comment elle s'appelait?

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:56.256 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- "CF-RCK".

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:57.324 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- J'avoue que c'est magnifique!

00:00:55.322 --> 00:00:58.391 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Et moi, je fais... si ma

00:00:56.356 --> 00:00:59.459 size:53% position:73% line:53%
