00:03:29.309 --> 00:03:35.281 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Bien, moi, en autant que...

00:03:30.343 --> 00:03:36.316 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en autant que ce n'est pas

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:41.888 size:53% position:73% line:53%
bassement mercantile, c'est-à-

00:03:35.382 --> 00:03:42.923 size:53% position:73% line:53%
