00:03:41.988 --> 00:03:47.093 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Il n'y aura pas de surprise,

00:03:43.023 --> 00:03:49.629 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mais comme... et là, on en est

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:50.664 size:53% position:73% line:53%
