00:04:01.641 --> 00:04:05.878 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et c'est juste ça.

00:04:03.877 --> 00:04:06.947 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Et Beau dommage va avoir

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:07.981 size:53% position:73% line:53%
