00:04:15.455 --> 00:04:19.626 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Honnêtement, honnêtement,

00:04:16.523 --> 00:04:20.694 size:53% position:73% line:53%
peut-être si tous les membres

00:04:17.591 --> 00:04:22.829 size:53% position:73% line:53%
